WEBVTT

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:03.660
Eh?

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.610
Your last opponents are us!

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:09.900
This is the rule!

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.610
See if you can, beat us!

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:58.050
The Birth
Of a Divine Idol!?

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:03.180
It, it can't be...

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.060
We have to face you?

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:09.220
What a turn of events-chanko!

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.300
I wonder if Sophie-sama is alright?

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:16.650
Hold up, they haven't even had a rest!

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.860
There will be no rests, that is also a rule.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.010
Eh!?

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:23.160
Janice!

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:28.410
It's fine, as soon as we put on the Divine Dress and Divine Heels,

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:29.870
our tiredness vanished.

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:33.380
It sure doesn't look that way.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.150
That's too harsh-nano!

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.010
Garu!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:39.720
She's right, there's no way they can beat the Goddesses!

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:44.590
It's impossible! They can't beat Goddesses!

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:47.100
Just how hard is it to become a Divine Idol!?

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:50.670
Solami Smile will receive no special treatment.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.400
Will you withdraw,

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:58.160
or will you take one step closer to Divine Idol by becoming Perfect Idols?

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:03.140
We'll do it!

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:04.870
And so!

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:13.730
The PriPara Divine Idol Grand Prix Final concert will begin!

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:20.070
PriPara fans from all over the world, bear witness

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:23.190
to this once in a century occurrence with us!

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:33.430
It's not good to hold it in for so long!

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:37.040
Hmm, strange clouds-daVinci...

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.400
Now's not the time for cloudspotting!

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.460
A pure white dress with golden relief,

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.090
a coord fit for a Goddess!

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:52.100
Emerald Eden Coord!

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.570
A high quality navy color gives it a solemn feel.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:01.600
The Blue Tourmaline gemstones are sparkling!

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.400
Dark Eden Coord!

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:08.300
Goddesses!

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.700
Don't go easy on them!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:11.720
Let them win!

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.270
But I want to watch them!

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.520
Janice is singing too...

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.440
Not even Onee-chan can win against these.

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:23.560
I love you all!

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.380
Jewlie, don't disappear!

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:27.400
It was just a joke when you disappeared right!?

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:31.630
The Parajuku PriPara is the best one out there!

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.710
Such an amazing PriPara!

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.880
Jewlie is the best!

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:42.840
I assure you too, I learned here, what love really is.

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:48.330
I wonder how many idols around the world have

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:53.960
laughed and sung their way to their dreams, or had them smashed and given up.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:03.130
And from giving up, coming back and dreaming even bigger!

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:09.370
The biggest dream are the idols who dreamed to become Divine Idols

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.490
and saw it through to the end!

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:17.170
Although this will be my last Grand Prix...

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.390
Oh no!

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.260
Don't go Jewlie!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.540
All idols

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:29.560
Voices become one.

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:34.110
Now, we will remember that feeling,

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:37.850
with love!

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.960
They're in perfect harmony...

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.760
I expected no less from twins.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:02.810
Janice.

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:03.900
Amazing!

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:53.220
I really like idols-nekon.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:06.120
Making Drama, switch on!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:32.640
Divine Cyalume Change!

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:43.370
What a performance!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.370
Janice...

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.830
That was a performance worthy of God-ucha.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:48.460
I liked the song!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.170
Amazing!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.830
Jewlie!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.160
Godesses are the best!

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.080
This can't be beat!

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.430
No way!

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:04.250
Onee-chan, how are you feeling?

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.410
If you'd like to become a demon instead, I can assist you with that-dearu.

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:09.950
Would you not spout such inane nonsense at a time like this?

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.960
Aroma doesn't mess around-nano!

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:12.650
Garu!

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.750
The Aromat Card says a demon will appear in your dream tonight-dearu!

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.750
Take that back!

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.620
It was the perfect performance.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:24.330
It was almost as if their spirits were connected.

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:25.470
Yeah.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:30.650
The Goddesses cosmically know everything about us.

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:34.720
How are we supposed to win against literal Goddesses!?

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.510
Dorothy, relax!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.050
Here's a towel-chanko!

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:43.540
I never knew becoming a Divine Idol was so tough...

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:48.160
But you've gotta win, if you don't you won't become Divine Idols!

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:50.380
And then we can't save Jululu...

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:53.610
Even I wanted to help her.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:54.620
Garu!

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.600
Lala will save us somehow!

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:59.310
Pshuuuu.

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:01.510
Sophie!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.300
I'll give you my meat, eat!

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.080
It's special meat!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.170
I'll give you my meatbuns too!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:12.050
Enough, we'll take their place and claim the rank of Divine Idol!

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:13.850
Oi, Devil!

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.950
Everyone, get back.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:26.670
Jululu...

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.110
We'll...

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:34.330
We'll save Jululu

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:38.180
and become Divine Idols!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.650
Sophie!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:44.850
Onee-chan?

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.800
Thanks, everyone!

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:55.970
But even just seeing their performance has made me nervous-pri!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:01.650
I can't phrase it well, but

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:04.910
I feel so Capisce Deluxe Max!

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.890
Don't steal my "max"!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:11.340
Amazing, our PriPara

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:13.550
has had Goddesses sing in it!

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.560
I want to sing too!

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:18.480
What song?

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.210
I guess for this situation...

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:25.320
I can't think of a song to properly convey our emotions-pri...

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:31.480
A new song.

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:39.690
New songs aren't banned in this tournament!

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:41.490
A new song!

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:44.210
Pri! It's the only shot we've got-pri!

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.850
In that case, allow me.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:48.750
Meganii-san!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:53.640
As you said, new songs are usually banned in tournaments, but

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:57.130
there are no rules when against Goddesses.

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:02.280
And besides, I too don't want Jewlie to disappear!

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.360
Me neither.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:04.070
Capisce!

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.450
Thanks-pri!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:10.160
Divine Idol Contestands, Solami Smile.

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:12.780
Please tell me,

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:16.530
what kind of song do you wish for?

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.970
And so, time's up!

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:33.820
Everyone!

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.050
We're Solami Smile!

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.760
Thanks for supporting us for so long!

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:48.910
All the times we thought things might not work out.

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:52.430
Honestly, we're tired of it...

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:56.080
Give it your all!

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.840
Solami Smile!

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:02.810
To beat the Goddesses performance might be impossible-pri!

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:08.260
But even if we collapse during our performance, we will never forget,

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.680
the fact that you've supported us.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.490
So cool!

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:17.100
The Goddesses sung "Our love to idols."

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:21.330
And so we've made a perfect song to respond to that!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.180
Lala-chan, don't give up!

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:25.530
The emotions of being an idol,

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:28.590
happiness, sadness,

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:30.200
all of them combined in to a song!

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:33.950
If the Goddesses love idols, then we love our friends!

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:37.950
Because we're all friends, we're all idols!

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:41.820
I think it's about on par with their song.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:45.220
I believe in you Solami Smile!

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:46.790
Please listen!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:49.800
I Friend You,

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:51.960
Forever!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.000
Amazing...

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.770
The songs do sound a bit alike though.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:26.340
Loving idols, Loving friends...

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:30.410
All friends, all Idols.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.780
They were the same thing all along!

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:36.940
This is a continuation from the Goddesses song!

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:48.990
Making Drama, switch on!

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:48.480
Divine Cyalume Change!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:39.850
Making Drama, switch on!

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:42.610
Come to the Divine Closet!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:49.180
I am Jewlie, the leader of Divine Idols!

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:52.800
Happiness to the new Divine Idols!

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.630
Now, go!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.850
To the world of Divine Idols!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:18.090
Divine Tiara!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.060
And be born!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:28.120
Divine Idols Solami Smile!

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.630
Congratulations Solami Smile!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:52.480
At long last, in our very own Pripara

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:55.330
new Divine Idols have been born!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:59.250
And their names are, Solami Smile!

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.850
You did so well!

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:06.770
Congratulations!

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.610
Mirei, congratulations pri!

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:10.480
Sophie!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.470
Game set!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.130
Lala-chan!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.600
Sophie-sama is so cool!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.520
Onee-chan!

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:29.980
Congratulations!

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:32.700
Thank you everyone!

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:33.940
Thank you!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:35.780
They actually did it...

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:38.070
Garuru will one day too-garu!

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.640
Well done, Parajuku.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.740
Mirei! Mirei! Mirei! Mirei!

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:49.040
Jululu, Janice!

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:50.760
Jululu!

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:53.420
Congratulations, Solami Smile!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:01.970
What's that cloud?

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:04.960
Jululu!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.170
You did amazing, Solami Smile!

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.250
But, I have to go.

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:17.270
It seems my punishment for breaking the rules has come.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.690
Janice, kneel before me.

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.400
As you wish, Onee-sama.

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:25.400
From now on, you're the Goddess of PriPara.

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:27.800
Understood, Onee-sama.

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:32.550
Please take care of the idols.

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:33.490
Jululu!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.940
I won't let you take my sister!

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:41.120
Goddess Power!

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:43.420
Janice...!

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:45.680
No! Let me go!

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.030
Otherwise you'll be gone too!

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.170
Janice!

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:50.600
I won't let you go alone!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:51.440
Janice!

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:52.910
Stop right there!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.720
No! You'll be sucked in by the system too!

00:20:57.720 --> 00:20:59.310
I'm already a Goddess!

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:03.920
If I can't protect my sister, then I'm not fit to protect the idols.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.020
Janice...

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:06.580
No!

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:09.190
Take this!

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:14.030
I leave PriPara in your hands!

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:29.100
Jululu! Janice!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.190
No way...

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:42.220
The Goddesses disappeared-kuma!

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:44.080
The light from the baton too!

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:46.970
Jululu...

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.980
What on earth has happened?

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:54.320
For the Goddesses to have disappeared from PriPara...

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:58.120
In the long history of PriPara,

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.790
this is the first time this has happened.

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:07.630
Leona!

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.210
The Sky Stage is falling!

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:15.520
What is going on-pri!?

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:18.910
Jululu... Janice...
